rces\nResearch Development\nThe Office of Research Development partners with faculty, students and staff across disciplines to identify funding opportunities, meet sponsor guidelines and develop competitive external grant proposals.\nSponsored Programs\nPre-award and post-award staff in the Office of Sponsored Programs provide comprehensive support with proposal submissions and the management of award funding.\nResearch Compliance\nThe Office of Research Compliance assures institutional and investigator compliance with applicable government regulations, policies and guidelines.\nTechnology Commercialization\nThe Office of Technology Commercialization serves faculty, staff and students in all aspects of intellectual property management, including licensing, patenting, the technology-transfer process and commercialization.\nWorkshops\nVirtual workshops are offered on finding funding, the submission process, managing awards and related topics to support the research community.\nLibrary research support services\nRowan University Libraries provides support for research data management, journal selection reports, open access publishing, ORCID accounts, and using metrics to analyze the impact of your work.\nDivision of University Research\nSouth Jersey Technology Park\n107 Gilbreth Parkway, Suite 103\nMullica Hill, NJ 08062\nresearch@rowan.edu\nRowan Research\nMain Menu\nRowan Research & Innovation\nContact Us\nDivision Offices\nResearch Development\nContact Us\nResources for Faculty\nPivot Funding Database\nWorkshops\nForms and Templates\nSponsored Programs\nContact Us\nCayuse\nPolicies and Procedures\nForms and Templates\nInstitutional Rates\nWorkshops\nOSP Reports\nFunding Agency Announcements\nPost-Award Management Tools\nEffort Certification\nResearch Compliance\nContact Us\nResearch Integrity\nFederal Policies\nResponsible Conduct of Research\nFederal Definitions and Regulations\nHistorical Cases\nCITI Training\nInstitutional Review Board\nGetting Started\nGuidance 